---
// Tracked mono wordmark with a 1px accent mark.
---
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3">
  <span class="relative block h-4 w-4 border border-accent rounded-[1px]" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="absolute inset-x-[3px] top-1/2 h-px -translate-y-1/2 bg-accent"></span>
  </span>
  <span class="font-mono text-[0.8125rem] font-medium tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">ZELUX</span>
</span>
